      "id": "question-scope",
      "name": "Question words & scope adverbs",
      "explain": "谁的 asks \"whose\"; 几 asks \"how many\" for small countable amounts (with a measure word), 多少 asks \"how much/how many\" for larger or uncountable amounts. 都 (\"all\") and 也 (\"also\") are scope adverbs that go right before the verb. 在 states where something/someone is.",
